{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"b1-practice-38","level":"B1","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"Umwelt und Energie 6","bn":"পরিবেশ ও শক্তি ৬"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„sparsam“ মানে কী?","options":["আঞ্চলিক","মিতব্যয়ী","বিশাল"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-38-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„regional“ মানে কী?","options":["সাপ্তাহিক","বিকল্প","আঞ্চলিক"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-38-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„umweltschonend“ মানে কী?","options":["পরিবেশের প্রতি সহানুভূতিশীল","জলবায়ুর জন্য ক্ষতিকর","বিপজ্জনক"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-38-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Fliegen ist ___. (জলবায়ুর জন্য ক্ষতিকর)","options":["sparsam","klimaschädlich","klimafreundlich"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-38-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Fahrrad ist ___. (জলবায়ুর জন্য বন্ধুত্বপূর্ণ)","options":["klimaschädlich","gefährlich","klimafreundlich"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-38-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„unnötig“ মানে কী?","options":["অপ্রয়োজনীয়","যুক্তিসঙ্গত","দীর্ঘমেয়াদী"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-38-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir kaufen ___ Obst vom Markt. (আঞ্চলিক)","options":["regionalen","regionales","regionaler"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Obst (das), ending -es।","id":"b1-practice-38-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„langfristig“ মানে কী?","options":["সম্প্রতি","সাপ্তাহিক","দীর্ঘমেয়াদী"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-38-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich habe keine Zeit, heute ___. (kochen)","options":["zu kochen","kochen","koche"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-38-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Es ist wichtig, Energie ___. (sparen)","options":["zu sparen","sparen","spart"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-38-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Es ist gesund, jeden Tag Sport ___. (machen)","options":["macht","zu machen","machen zu"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-38-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"___ mit dem Auto zu fahren, nehme ich den Bus. (বদলে)","options":["Ohne","Um","Statt"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-38-q12"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Er ist gegangen, ___ die 